    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Embed Anything, Anywhere – The Smart Way.</strong></p>\n<p>WPXero Iframe is your all-in-one solution for effortlessly embedding external content into your WordPress site. Whether you want to showcase videos, audio, maps, or other iframe-based content, this lightweight yet powerful Gutenberg block plugin makes it simple and seamless.</p>\n<p>Built specifically for the modern WordPress editor, WPXero Iframe enhances your content creation workflow and helps bring your pages to life.</p>\n<p><strong>✨ Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>🔧 Seamless Gutenberg Integration</strong><br />\nAdd iframe blocks directly from the editor — no coding required.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>🎥 YouTube &amp; Vimeo Support</strong><br />\nEasily embed videos from YouTube or Vimeo and deliver rich media experiences to your audience.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>🌐 Universal Embed Support</strong><br />\nEmbed content from virtually any site that supports iframe embedding — from maps to third-party tools.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>🎨 Customization Made Simple</strong><br />\nAdjust width, height, responsiveness, and other display settings to match your design and branding.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>📱 100% Responsive</strong><br />\nYour embedded content automatically adapts to fit all screen sizes for a flawless mobile experience.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>WPXero Iframe is ideal for bloggers, marketers, educators, developers — anyone who wants to enrich their content with embedded media without hassle.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Go to your WordPress dashboard.</li>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Plugins &gt; Add New</strong>.</li>\n<li>Search for <strong>WPXero Iframe</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Install Now</strong>, then <strong>Activate</strong>.</li>\n<li>Use the new <strong>Iframe Block</strong> inside the Gutenberg editor to embed external content.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatibility updates for WordPress 6.8</li>\n<li>Minor improvements and optimizations</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release with core features</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "WPXero Iframe is a powerful and flexible Gutenberg block plugin that lets you embed content from YouTube, Vimeo, Google Maps, and virtually any websit &hellip;",
    "description": "<p><strong>Embed Anything, Anywhere – The Smart Way.</strong></p>\n<p>WPXero Iframe is your all-in-one solution for effortlessly embedding external content into your WordPress site. Whether you want to showcase videos, audio, maps, or other iframe-based content, this lightweight yet powerful Gutenberg block plugin makes it simple and seamless.</p>\n<p>Built specifically for the modern WordPress editor, WPXero Iframe enhances your content creation workflow and helps bring your pages to life.</p>\n<p><strong>✨ Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>🔧 Seamless Gutenberg Integration</strong><br />\nAdd iframe blocks directly from the editor — no coding required.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>🎥 YouTube &amp; Vimeo Support</strong><br />\nEasily embed videos from YouTube or Vimeo and deliver rich media experiences to your audience.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>🌐 Universal Embed Support</strong><br />\nEmbed content from virtually any site that supports iframe embedding — from maps to third-party tools.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>🎨 Customization Made Simple</strong><br />\nAdjust width, height, responsiveness, and other display settings to match your design and branding.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>📱 100% Responsive</strong><br />\nYour embedded content automatically adapts to fit all screen sizes for a flawless mobile experience.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>WPXero Iframe is ideal for bloggers, marketers, educators, developers — anyone who wants to enrich their content with embedded media without hassle.</p>\n",
